            "sid": "ISA 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo aníng niri oó', «Tsaxwaaeé', asma aníng aga qwaár, aníng a heé afa slasla/aár, nee an hoót tla/ángw múk afe slasla/arén wa ale, nee ilaaeé' waawutmo ngwaa ariyé', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
